// expect: 8
// The emission-order pin (the relocation's written decision): emission
// iterates the decls' SOURCE order — zeta before alpha before main —
// never the demand order the worklist constructs in (main -> alpha ->
// zeta). Demand-order emission is 9.2's option, taken there or not at all.
fn zeta() = 7
fn alpha() = zeta() + 1
fn main() = alpha()
